  "title": "Warm and Spicy Autumn Punch",
  "description": "This warm and spicy autumn punch recipe features apple juice, pineapple juice, and honey, and spiced with clove-studded oranges, cinnamon, and nutmeg.",
  "authors": [
    "Michele O'Sullivan"
